=== 1. Login as Basketball Rep ===
OK, got token

=== 2. Scope check: Basketball rep touches Cricket -> expect 403 ===
403 {'detail': "Rep scoped to 'Basketball' cannot act on 'Cricket'"}

=== 3. Add player to Basketball -> expect 201 ===
201 {'player_id': 1, 'team_id': 1}

=== 4. Same player, second Basketball team, same season -> expect 409 (duplication) ===
409 {'detail': 'Player already on a team in Basketball for this season (UNIQUE constraint failed: team_members.player_id, team_members.sport, team_members.season_id)'}

=== 5. Same player joins Cricket (different sport) via Cricket rep -> expect 201 (allowed) ===
201 {'player_id': 1, 'team_id': 3}

=== 6. Book a Basketball match, Main Court, no conflicts -> expect 201 DRAFT ===
201 {'match_id': 1, 'status': 'DRAFT', 'version': 1}

=== 7. Book a SECOND match, same venue, overlapping time -> expect 409 venue conflict ===
409 {'detail': {'conflicts': [{'type': 'venue', 'conflicting_match_id': 1}, {'type': 'player', 'player_id': 1, 'player_name': 'Pashi', 'conflicting_match_id': 1}]}}

=== 8. Cricket rep tries to book Pashi (on Basketball roster, overlapping time), diff venue -> expect 409 PLAYER conflict ===
409 {'detail': {'conflicts': [{'type': 'player', 'player_id': 1, 'player_name': 'Pashi', 'conflicting_match_id': 1}]}}
>>> THIS is the cross-league player conflict the whole project is about <<<

=== 9. Publish match1 with correct version -> expect 200 CONFIRMED ===
200 {'match_id': 1, 'status': 'CONFIRMED', 'version': 2}

=== 10. Publish AGAIN with the now-stale version -> expect 409 (optimistic concurrency) ===
409 {'detail': 'Match is not in DRAFT status'}

=== 11. Viewer read path (no auth) -> confirmed match should appear ===
200 [{'id': 1, 'home_team_id': 1, 'away_team_id': 2, 'venue_id': 1, 'start_time': '2026-10-01T18:00:00', 'end_time': '2026-10-01T19:00:00', 'status': 'CONFIRMED', 'sport': 'Basketball', 'season_id': 1, 'version': 2, 'job_id': None}]

=== 12. Async schedule generation job -> expect QUEUED, then poll to COMPLETED ===
202 {'job_id': 1, 'status': 'QUEUED'}
  poll: RUNNING
  poll: RUNNING
  poll: RUNNING
  poll: COMPLETED
{'job_id': 1, 'status': 'COMPLETED', 'result': {'created_draft_match_ids': [2], 'skipped': [{'fixture': {'home_team_id': 1, 'away_team_id': 2, 'venue_id': 1, 'start_time': '2026-10-01T18:00:00', 'end_time': '2026-10-01T19:00:00'}, 'conflicts': [{'type': 'venue', 'conflicting_match_id': 1}, {'type': 'player', 'player_id': 1, 'player_name': 'Pashi', 'conflicting_match_id': 1}]}]}}


=== ALL CHECKS PASSED ===

